{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060264/block/singleImage/3248283/df/01M5V14JA7W5RAHJGA6JZR4MWX.png?updatedAt=1792982288\"/><figcaption>落馬洲青山公路米埔段（Google Map/資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>周日（25日）晚上11時許，警方接獲有人報案，指懷疑其朋友在落馬洲青山公路米埔段一村屋上吊。救援人員接報到場，消防將該名35歲姓冼男子解下，他現場被證實死亡。 經初步調查，相信男子在上址一房間以一條長約2米的繩子上吊。警方於現場沒有檢獲遺書。男子死因有待驗屍後確定，案件列作屍體發現。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:37.174151+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":170,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T02:38:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T05:18:05.253368+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:40:23.362654+00:00","content_hash":"3d002d2562c29a2e566fa98b067611b04fe2521da2df5df328a0ca70deda472f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:37.174151+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}